{"id": "EUVD-2026-89434", "enisaUuid": "1e178e17-6c9d-32e8-9ed8-385a67fa7852", "description": "U-Boot before 2026.10-rc5 contains a buffer overflow in nfs_readlink_reply() function in net/nfs-common.c when processing NFS server responses. A malicious NFS server can send crafted READLINK replies with negative or oversized symlink length values to corrupt memory and crash the bootloader.", "datePublished": "2026-09-29T21:29:23", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-30T13:47:56", "baseScore": 8.8, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/u-boot/u-boot/commit/1c0aff3a5fbfeee7a8948f624e0b8554e6e0d8fd", "https://github.com/u-boot/u-boot/blob/v2026.07/net/nfs-common.c#L643", "https://github.com/u-boot/u-boot", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/u-boot-before-2026.10-rc5-buffer-overflow-via-nfs-readlink"], "aliases": ["GHSA-r9ch-9wx4-f978", "CVE-2026-74221"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.34, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "2cf5588c-22be-3a83-b801-0a773a057b31", "product": {"name": "U-Boot", "vendor": {"name": "DENX Software Engineering"}}, "product_version": "0 <2026.10-rc5"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "b805877b-fb02-3d81-b5bf-9699d4156c73", "vendor": {"name": "U-Boot"}}], "isExploited": false}